    "description": "This illuminated large format trade show display is suitable for all large-scale marketing purposes. Radiant and eye-catching with its bright illumination, this display is perfectly suited for attracting the attention of a wide amount of customers and clientele.\nSEG displays uti…",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">This illuminated large format trade show display is suitable for all large-scale marketing purposes. Radiant and eye-catching with its bright illumination, this display is perfectly suited for attracting the attention of a wide amount of customers and clientele.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">SEG displays utilize a silicone edge graphic (SEG) to create a seamless and visually appealing presentation. It is commonly used in the field of visual marketing and trade shows.  The silicone strip is designed to fit into a channel on the display frame. This creates a taut and smooth appearance without any visible seams on the front surface of the display. Changing out SEG graphics is a breeze. </p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Interior LED lighting enhances the backlit fabric prints making these displays true show-stoppers.  </p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">High resolution UV printed</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">UV safe that will last for years</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Blackout Fabric included for Single Sided option</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Material:</strong></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">6 oz. Premium Backlit Fabric</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Aluminum Frame</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Size and Weight:</strong></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Display Size: 118.1\"W x 88.6\"H x 17\"D</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Weight: 31 lbs (each box, 2 boxes total)</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Package Size: 57\"W x 13.5\"H x 7.5\"D (box1) and 48.5\"W x 13.5\"H x 7.5\"D (box2)</li>\n</ul>",
    "descriptionText": "This illuminated large format trade show display is suitable for all large-scale marketing purposes. Radiant and eye-catching with its bright illumination, this display is perfectly suited for attracting the attention of a wide amount of customers and clientele.\nSEG displays utilize a silicone edge graphic (SEG) to create a seamless and visually appealing presentation. It is commonly used in the field of visual marketing and trade shows. The silicone strip is designed to fit into a channel on the display frame. This creates a taut and smooth appearance without any visible seams on the front surface of the display. Changing out SEG graphics is a breeze.\nInterior LED lighting enhances the backlit fabric prints making these displays true show-stoppers.\nFeatures:\nHigh resolution UV printed\nUV safe that will last for years\nBlackout Fabric included for Single Sided option\nMaterial:\n6 oz. Premium Backlit Fabric\nAluminum Frame\nSize and Weight:\nDisplay Size: 118.1\"W x 88.6\"H x 17\"D\nWeight: 31 lbs (each box, 2 boxes total)\nPackage Size: 57\"W x 13.5\"H x 7.5\"D (box1) and 48.5\"W x 13.5\"H x 7.5\"D (box2)",
