    "descriptionHtml": "<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Our largest SEG display at 20 feet wide, this impressive fabric wall is ideal for any large-scale marketing purpose. Proudly display marketing material on our largest offered format to attract attention from a broad range of customers and clientele.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">SEG displays utilize a silicone edge graphic (SEG) to create a seamless and visually appealing presentation. It is commonly used in the field of visual marketing and trade shows.  The silicone strip is designed to fit into a channel on the display frame. This creates a taut and smooth appearance without any visible seams on the front surface of the display. Changing out SEG graphics is a breeze. </p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">High resolution UV printed</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">UV safe that will last for years</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Material:</strong></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">6 oz. Premium Backlit Fabric</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Aluminum Frame</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Size and Weight:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Display Size: 236.2\"W x 88.6\"H x 18\"D</li>\n<li>Weight: 38.5 lbs (each box, 2 boxes total)</li>\n<li>Package Size: 48\"W x 9\"H x 8.5\"D (each box, 2 boxes total)</li>\n</ul>",
