    "descriptionHtml": "<p><span> Make Your Mark with Unique Designs -Perfect for personalizing school supplies, office gear, and home decor. Ideal for creatives, entrepreneurs, and anyone wanting to express their individuality. A thoughtful gift for friends, family, or colleagues. These die-cut stickers can be tailored to any shape, adding flair and personality to your everyday items or marketing materials.</span></p>\n<p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"777\">🔹 <strong data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"777\">Key Features</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"1253\">✂️ <strong data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"806\">Custom Die Cut Shape</strong> – Cut precisely to the outline of your design<br data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"855\">🎨 <strong data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"881\">Full-Color Printing</strong> – Sharp, vibrant, high-resolution graphics<br data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"927\">🧲 <strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"956\">Premium Vinyl Material</strong> – Durable and professional finish<br data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"993\">💧 <strong data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1015\">Water-Resistant</strong> – Suitable for indoor and outdoor use<br data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1056\">☀️ <strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1082\">Fade-Resistant Inks</strong> – Long-lasting color performance<br data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1118\">💰 <strong data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1138\">No Die Charge</strong> – No extra fees for custom shapes<br data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1175\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1195\">Versatile Use</strong> – Ideal for branding, packaging, promotions, and events</p>",
    "descriptionText": "Make Your Mark with Unique Designs -Perfect for personalizing school supplies, office gear, and home decor. Ideal for creatives, entrepreneurs, and anyone wanting to express their individuality. A thoughtful gift for friends, family, or colleagues. These die-cut stickers can be tailored to any shape, adding flair and personality to your everyday items or marketing materials.\n🔹 Key Features\n✂️ Custom Die Cut Shape – Cut precisely to the outline of your design\n🎨 Full-Color Printing – Sharp, vibrant, high-resolution graphics\n🧲 Premium Vinyl Material – Durable and professional finish\n💧 Water-Resistant – Suitable for indoor and outdoor use\n☀️ Fade-Resistant Inks – Long-lasting color performance\n💰 No Die Charge – No extra fees for custom shapes\n📦 Versatile Use – Ideal for branding, packaging, promotions, and events",
