    "description": "Promote your brand with maximum visibility using our Pole Banner Set, designed for street poles, light posts, and outdoor installations. These double-sided banners deliver high-impact messaging from both directions, making them ideal for storefronts, downtown promotions, campuse…",
    "descriptionHtml": "<div>\n\n<p data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"903\">Promote your brand with maximum visibility using our <strong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"654\">Pole Banner Set</strong>, designed for street poles, light posts, and outdoor installations. These <strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"753\">double-sided banners</strong> deliver high-impact messaging from both directions, making them ideal for storefronts, downtown promotions, campuses, events, and municipal branding.</p>\n<p data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"1198\">Each banner is printed <strong data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"981\">front and back at high resolution (720 × 720 DPI)</strong> on durable <strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1018\">18 oz. blockout vinyl</strong>, ensuring vibrant graphics with zero show-through. The set includes <strong data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1112\">all required hardware</strong>, allowing for quick and secure installation on poles up to <strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1197\">12 inches in diameter</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1445\">Built for long-term outdoor use, the banners are <strong data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1272\">waterproof, UV safe</strong>, and can include <strong data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1304\">wind slits</strong> to extend lifespan in high-wind environments. Reinforced construction and quality materials ensure a clean, professional display that lasts.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1470\">🔹 Key Features</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"2207\">🏙️ <strong data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1495\">Pole Banner Set</strong> – Designed for street poles and light posts<br data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1542\">📐 <strong data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1561\">Banner Width</strong> – 24 inches wide<br data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1581\">🔁 <strong data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1609\">Double-Sided Graphics</strong> – One banner printed front &amp; back<br data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1646\">🎨 <strong data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1677\">High-Resolution Printing</strong> – Digitally printed at 720 × 720 DPI<br data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1717\">💪 <strong data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1752\">Heavy-Duty Hardware Included</strong> –<br data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1757\">• 2 Fiberglass Arms<br data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1779\">• 2 Mounting Brackets<br data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1803\">• 4 Steel Bands<br data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1821\">🌦️ <strong data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1842\">Outdoor-Ready</strong> – Waterproof &amp; UV safe<br data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1868\">💨 <strong data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1895\">Wind Slits Available</strong> – Optional for increased durability<br data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1934\">🔩 <strong data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1955\">Brass Grommets</strong> – One on each corner for added strength<br data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"1998\">🧵 <strong data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2028\">Reinforced Construction</strong> –<br data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2033\">• No hems<br data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2045\">• Double-stitched pole pockets (top &amp; bottom)<br data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2093\">📏 <strong data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2118\">Pole Compatibility</strong> – Metal cable tie fits poles up to 12\" diameter<br data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2169\">🪢 <strong data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2194\">Steel Bands Length</strong> – 40\" long</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2235\">🔹 Material Option</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2282\">🧱 <strong data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2259\">Banner Material</strong>: 18 oz. Blockout Vinyl</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2309\">🔹 Imprint Method</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2362\">🖨️ High-Resolution Digital Printing (720 × 720 DPI)</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2399\">🔹 Artwork Setup Guidelines</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2456\"><strong data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2456\">How to set up your artwork for the Pole Banner Set:</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2772\">📐 Your submitted graphic must match the <strong data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2533\">exact print dimensions ordered</strong>.<br data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2537\">🪜 There are <strong data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2595\">2-inch pole pockets at the top and bottom</strong> of the banner.<br data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2613\">⚠️ The seams from the hemmed pole pockets will be visible <strong data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2707\">2 inches from the top and bottom</strong> of the graphic—please keep important content clear of this area.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2800\">🔹 What’s Included</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2927\">📦 1× Double-Sided Pole Banner (Front &amp; Back Printed)<br data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"2858\">🦾 2× Fiberglass Arms<br data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2882\">🧱 2× Mounting Brackets<br data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2908\">🪢 4× Steel Bands</p>\n🔹 Primary Usage\n<p data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"3080\">Street poles, light posts, downtown banners, storefr</p>\n</div>",
    "descriptionText": "Promote your brand with maximum visibility using our Pole Banner Set, designed for street poles, light posts, and outdoor installations. These double-sided banners deliver high-impact messaging from both directions, making them ideal for storefronts, downtown promotions, campuses, events, and municipal branding.\nEach banner is printed front and back at high resolution (720 × 720 DPI) on durable 18 oz. blockout vinyl, ensuring vibrant graphics with zero show-through. The set includes all required hardware, allowing for quick and secure installation on poles up to 12 inches in diameter.\nBuilt for long-term outdoor use, the banners are waterproof, UV safe, and can include wind slits to extend lifespan in high-wind environments. Reinforced construction and quality materials ensure a clean, professional display that lasts.\n🔹 Key Features\n🏙️ Pole Banner Set – Designed for street poles and light posts\n📐 Banner Width – 24 inches wide\n🔁 Double-Sided Graphics – One banner printed front & back\n🎨 High-Resolution Printing – Digitally printed at 720 × 720 DPI\n💪 Heavy-Duty Hardware Included –\n• 2 Fiberglass Arms\n• 2 Mounting Brackets\n• 4 Steel Bands\n🌦️ Outdoor-Ready – Waterproof & UV safe\n💨 Wind Slits Available – Optional for increased durability\n🔩 Brass Grommets – One on each corner for added strength\n🧵 Reinforced Construction –\n• No hems\n• Double-stitched pole pockets (top & bottom)\n📏 Pole Compatibility – Metal cable tie fits poles up to 12\" diameter\n🪢 Steel Bands Length – 40\" long\n🔹 Material Option\n🧱 Banner Material: 18 oz. Blockout Vinyl\n🔹 Imprint Method\n🖨️ High-Resolution Digital Printing (720 × 720 DPI)\n🔹 Artwork Setup Guidelines\nHow to set up your artwork for the Pole Banner Set:\n📐 Your submitted graphic must match the exact print dimensions ordered.\n🪜 There are 2-inch pole pockets at the top and bottom of the banner.\n⚠️ The seams from the hemmed pole pockets will be visible 2 inches from the top and bottom of the graphic—please keep important content clear of this area.\n🔹 What’s Included\n📦 1× Double-Sided Pole Banner (Front & Back Printed)\n🦾 2× Fiberglass Arms\n🧱 2× Mounting Brackets\n🪢 4× Steel Bands\n🔹 Primary Usage\nStreet poles, light posts, downtown banners, storefr",
