    "description": "Capture attention from every direction with our Premium Angled Flags, designed for high-impact branding at trade shows, outdoor events, storefronts, festivals, and canopy setups. The angled shape creates a bold visual flow that naturally attracts attention and increases brand vi…",
    "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"table-wrapper\"><br></div>\n\n<p data-end=\"840\" data-start=\"548\">Capture attention from every direction with our <strong data-end=\"620\" data-start=\"596\">Premium Angled Flags</strong>, designed for high-impact branding at trade shows, outdoor events, storefronts, festivals, and canopy setups. The angled shape creates a bold visual flow that naturally attracts attention and increases brand visibility.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1125\" data-start=\"842\">Available in <strong data-end=\"886\" data-start=\"855\">9ft, 12ft, and 15ft heights</strong>, all flags are <strong data-end=\"929\" data-start=\"902\">double-sided by default</strong>, ensuring your message is seen from both sides. Your artwork is printed using <strong data-end=\"1054\" data-start=\"1008\">high-resolution full-color dye sublimation</strong> on durable knitted polyester fabric for vibrant, long-lasting results.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1388\" data-start=\"1127\">Each flag comes <strong data-end=\"1187\" data-start=\"1143\">standard with a cross base and water bag</strong>, making it ideal for both indoor and outdoor use. For added versatility, you can upgrade to <strong data-end=\"1297\" data-start=\"1280\">ground stakes</strong> or a <strong data-end=\"1319\" data-start=\"1303\">mounting kit</strong>, allowing the flag to be securely mounted directly to a canopy tent.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1564\" data-start=\"1390\">Built with <strong data-end=\"1441\" data-start=\"1401\">strong yet flexible fiberglass poles</strong>, these flags are engineered to perform reliably in various environments while remaining lightweight and easy to transport.</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"1589\" data-start=\"1571\">🔹 Key Features</h2>\n<p data-end=\"2134\" data-start=\"1591\">🚩 <strong data-end=\"1616\" data-start=\"1594\">Angled Flag Design</strong> – Dynamic shape for maximum visibility<br data-end=\"1658\" data-start=\"1655\">📏 <strong data-end=\"1680\" data-start=\"1661\">Available Sizes</strong> – 9ft, 12ft, and 15ft heights<br data-end=\"1713\" data-start=\"1710\">🔁 <strong data-end=\"1750\" data-start=\"1716\">Double-Sided Printing Included</strong> – Standard on all flags<br data-end=\"1777\" data-start=\"1774\">🎨 <strong data-end=\"1810\" data-start=\"1780\">Full-Color Dye Sublimation</strong> – Sharp, fade-resistant printing<br data-end=\"1846\" data-start=\"1843\">💪 <strong data-end=\"1869\" data-start=\"1849\">Fiberglass Poles</strong> – Lightweight, flexible, and durable<br data-end=\"1909\" data-start=\"1906\">⚓ <strong data-end=\"1928\" data-start=\"1911\">Base Included</strong> – Cross base + water bag included by default<br data-end=\"1976\" data-start=\"1973\">🏕️ <strong data-end=\"2009\" data-start=\"1980\">Multiple Mounting Options</strong> – Upgrade to ground stakes or canopy mounting kit<br data-end=\"2062\" data-start=\"2059\">🧳 <strong data-end=\"2090\" data-start=\"2065\">Portable &amp; Easy Setup</strong> – Fast assembly for events and promotions</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"2161\" data-start=\"2141\">🔹 Imprint Method</h2>\n<p data-end=\"2192\" data-start=\"2162\">🖨️ Full-Color Dye Sublimation</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"2214\" data-start=\"2199\">🔹 Materials</h2>\n<p data-end=\"2329\" data-start=\"2216\">🧵 Graphic / Flag: Knitted Polyester<br data-end=\"2255\" data-start=\"2252\">🦾 Hardware: 100% Epoxy Fiberglass<br data-end=\"2292\" data-start=\"2289\">🎒 Carry Case: 600 Denier Polyester</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"2355\" data-start=\"2336\">🔹 Primary Usage</h2>\n<p data-end=\"2483\" data-start=\"2356\">Trade shows, outdoor events, canopy tents, vendor booths, storefront advertising, festivals, promotions, and brand activations.</p>\n<h2>\n<strong>Warranty</strong><br>\n</h2>\n<p>We stand behind the quality of our products. Our warranty covers any factory defects or damage that occurs during shipping. However, please note that we do not cover damage resulting from extreme weather conditions, misuse, or any circumstances beyond our control.</p>",
    "descriptionText": "Capture attention from every direction with our Premium Angled Flags, designed for high-impact branding at trade shows, outdoor events, storefronts, festivals, and canopy setups. The angled shape creates a bold visual flow that naturally attracts attention and increases brand visibility.\nAvailable in 9ft, 12ft, and 15ft heights, all flags are double-sided by default, ensuring your message is seen from both sides. Your artwork is printed using high-resolution full-color dye sublimation on durable knitted polyester fabric for vibrant, long-lasting results.\nEach flag comes standard with a cross base and water bag, making it ideal for both indoor and outdoor use. For added versatility, you can upgrade to ground stakes or a mounting kit, allowing the flag to be securely mounted directly to a canopy tent.\nBuilt with strong yet flexible fiberglass poles, these flags are engineered to perform reliably in various environments while remaining lightweight and easy to transport.\n🔹 Key Features\n🚩 Angled Flag Design – Dynamic shape for maximum visibility\n📏 Available Sizes – 9ft, 12ft, and 15ft heights\n🔁 Double-Sided Printing Included – Standard on all flags\n🎨 Full-Color Dye Sublimation – Sharp, fade-resistant printing\n💪 Fiberglass Poles – Lightweight, flexible, and durable\n⚓ Base Included – Cross base + water bag included by default\n🏕️ Multiple Mounting Options – Upgrade to ground stakes or canopy mounting kit\n🧳 Portable & Easy Setup – Fast assembly for events and promotions\n🔹 Imprint Method\n🖨️ Full-Color Dye Sublimation\n🔹 Materials\n🧵 Graphic / Flag: Knitted Polyester\n🦾 Hardware: 100% Epoxy Fiberglass\n🎒 Carry Case: 600 Denier Polyester\n🔹 Primary Usage\nTrade shows, outdoor events, canopy tents, vendor booths, storefront advertising, festivals, promotions, and brand activations.\nWarranty\nWe stand behind the quality of our products. Our warranty covers any factory defects or damage that occurs during shipping. However, please note that we do not cover damage resulting from extreme weather conditions, misuse, or any circumstances beyond our control.",
