    "descriptionHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/5c3yku9nt6jgtf0gccncp/Premium.zip?rlkey=lvasp8ue51yrufc9gw8woydmi&amp;dl=0\">Download Template</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1564/9941/files/WX20240912-212211_2x_ecfeb021-5306-43ef-9dfa-ae718355db1e.png?v=1726147400\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Retractable stand is very appealing and features a sleek and stealthy base. Use it to gain attention of those passing by. This stand has adjustable poles to allow for graphic size adjustment. Stand includes a traveling bag.</p>\n<p>Kit include:</p>\n<p>1 pc frame</p>\n<p>1pc vinyl graphic</p>\n<p>Stand Size: 37.5&quot; W x 9.5&quot; D x 3&quot; H (36&#x27;&#x27;)</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Shipping Dimensions: 41&quot; H x 13&quot; W x 5&quot; D</li>\n  <li>Shipping Weight: 17 lbs</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Material Options:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>13 oz. Matte Vinyl Banner</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Safety Margins: (To ensure all graphic elements appear)</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Top: 1&quot;</li>\n  <li>Bottom: 3&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>1 Year Product Warranty - Standard warranty is a one year parts and labor warranty which warrants product against defects in material and workmanship. It does not cover damage due to accidents, abuse, or normal wear and tear. Products found to be defective will be replaced or repaired at factory&#x27;s discretion</p>",
    "descriptionText": "Download Template (https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/5c3yku9nt6jgtf0gccncp/Premium.zip?rlkey=lvasp8ue51yrufc9gw8woydmi&dl=0)\n\nRetractable stand is very appealing and features a sleek and stealthy base. Use it to gain attention of those passing by. This stand has adjustable poles to allow for graphic size adjustment. Stand includes a traveling bag.\n\nKit include:\n\n1 pc frame\n\n1pc vinyl graphic\n\nStand Size: 37.5\" W x 9.5\" D x 3\" H (36'')\n\nShipping Dimensions: 41\" H x 13\" W x 5\" D\nShipping Weight: 17 lbs\n\nMaterial Options:\n\n13 oz. Matte Vinyl Banner\n\nSafety Margins: (To ensure all graphic elements appear)\n\nTop: 1\"\nBottom: 3\"\n\n1 Year Product Warranty - Standard warranty is a one year parts and labor warranty which warrants product against defects in material and workmanship. It does not cover damage due to accidents, abuse, or normal wear and tear. Products found to be defective will be replaced or repaired at factory's discretion",
    "howToOrderHtml": "<ul>\n  <li>SKU 406019</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>3 Easy Steps</h3>\n<p>Step 1: Shop 🛒<br><br>Pick your products and add-ons, then add your order to the cart.</p>\n<p>Step 2: Payment 💳<br><br>Go to your cart and choose your payment option:<br><br>Full payment: your design gets priority 🚀<br><br>Deposit: start the design now and pay the remaining balance after artwork approval<br><br>(Deposit option applies only to orders over $295 USD. Orders below this amount require full payment.)</p>\n<p>Step 3: Artwork 🎨<br><br>Complete checkout and upload your artwork using the provided link.<br><br>Don’t see it? No worries — we’ll email it to you.</p>",
