    "description": "Create a clean, professional presentation with our Stretch Table Cover, designed to deliver edge-to-edge (full bleed) branding with a sleek, wrinkle-free fit. Perfect for trade shows, events, vendor booths, and promotions, this cover transforms standard tables into polished bran…",
    "descriptionHtml": "<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<div>\n\n<div>\n<p>Create a clean, professional presentation with our <strong data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"320\">Stretch Table Cover</strong>, designed to deliver <strong data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"380\">edge-to-edge (full bleed) branding</strong> with a sleek, wrinkle-free fit. Perfect for trade shows, events, vendor booths, and promotions, this cover transforms standard tables into polished brand displays.</p>\n</div>\n<p data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"846\">Printed using <strong data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"606\">high-resolution full-color dye sublimation</strong> on <strong data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"646\">Power Stretch polyester material</strong>, your artwork appears vibrant, sharp, and long-lasting. A <strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"728\">rear zipper closure</strong> ensures a snug, tailored fit that stays in place throughout your event while maintaining a smooth, professional look.</p>\n<p data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"1038\">This stretch table cover is available in <strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"922\">4ft, 6ft, and 8ft table sizes</strong>, making it easy to match your setup. Each cover includes a <strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1006\">convenient carry bag</strong> for easy transport and storage.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1063\">🔹 Key Features</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1548\">🧵 <strong data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1102\">Power Stretch Polyester Fabric</strong> – Durable, wrinkle-resistant, and form-fitting<br data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1152\">🎨 <strong data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1185\">Full-Color Dye Sublimation</strong> – Vibrant, fade-resistant custom graphics<br data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1230\">🖼️ <strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1257\">Full Bleed Printing</strong> – Edge-to-edge branding coverage<br data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1293\">🔒 <strong data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1319\">Rear Zipper Closure</strong> – Secure, snug fit with a clean finish<br data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1361\">📏 <strong data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1389\">Multiple Size Options</strong> – Available for 4ft, 6ft, and 8ft tables<br data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1433\">🧳 <strong data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1458\">Carry Bag Included</strong> – Easy transport and storage<br data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1490\">⚙️ <strong data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1507\">Easy Setup</strong> – Slip-on design for fast installation</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1589\">🔹 Available Sizes &amp; Dimensions</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1639\">📐 <strong data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1616\">Standard 8ft Table</strong><br data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1619\">96\"W × 30\"H × 30\"D</p>\n<p data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1689\">📐 <strong data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1666\">Standard 6ft Table</strong><br data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1669\">72\"W × 30\"H × 30\"D</p>\n<p data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1739\">📐 <strong data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1716\">Standard 4ft Table</strong><br data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1719\">48\"W × 30\"H × 24\"D</p>\n<p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1798\">⚠️ Dimensions may vary slightly depending on table style.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1835\">🔹 Fits Approx. Table Sizes</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1932\">8' Fitted: 96\"W × 30\"H × 30\"D<br data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1869\">6' Fitted: 72\"W × 30\"H × 30\"D<br data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1901\">4' Fitted: 48\"W × 30\"H × 24\"D</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1512\">🔹 Imprint Method</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1556\">🖨️ Full-Color Dye Sublimation (Full Bleed)</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1578\">🔹 Materials</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1614\">🧵 Fabric: Stretch Polyester Blend</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1640\">🔹 Compatibility</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1706\">📐 Designed to fit standard event tables (size options available)</p>\n<br>\n<h2 data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1732\">🔹 Primary Usage</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1842\">Trade shows, exhibitions, vendor booths, conferences, retail promotions, pop-up shops, and brand activations.</p>\n<h3><span size=\"2\"><span>Warranty</span></span></h3>\n<p>We stand behind the quality of our products. Our warranty covers any factory defects or damage that occurs during shipping. However, please note that we do not cover damage resulting from extreme weather conditions, misuse, or any circumstances beyond our control.</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>",
    "descriptionText": "Create a clean, professional presentation with our Stretch Table Cover, designed to deliver edge-to-edge (full bleed) branding with a sleek, wrinkle-free fit. Perfect for trade shows, events, vendor booths, and promotions, this cover transforms standard tables into polished brand displays.\nPrinted using high-resolution full-color dye sublimation on Power Stretch polyester material, your artwork appears vibrant, sharp, and long-lasting. A rear zipper closure ensures a snug, tailored fit that stays in place throughout your event while maintaining a smooth, professional look.\nThis stretch table cover is available in 4ft, 6ft, and 8ft table sizes, making it easy to match your setup. Each cover includes a convenient carry bag for easy transport and storage.\n🔹 Key Features\n🧵 Power Stretch Polyester Fabric – Durable, wrinkle-resistant, and form-fitting\n🎨 Full-Color Dye Sublimation – Vibrant, fade-resistant custom graphics\n🖼️ Full Bleed Printing – Edge-to-edge branding coverage\n🔒 Rear Zipper Closure – Secure, snug fit with a clean finish\n📏 Multiple Size Options – Available for 4ft, 6ft, and 8ft tables\n🧳 Carry Bag Included – Easy transport and storage\n⚙️ Easy Setup – Slip-on design for fast installation\n🔹 Available Sizes & Dimensions\n📐 Standard 8ft Table\n96\"W × 30\"H × 30\"D\n📐 Standard 6ft Table\n72\"W × 30\"H × 30\"D\n📐 Standard 4ft Table\n48\"W × 30\"H × 24\"D\n⚠️ Dimensions may vary slightly depending on table style.\n🔹 Fits Approx. Table Sizes\n8' Fitted: 96\"W × 30\"H × 30\"D\n6' Fitted: 72\"W × 30\"H × 30\"D\n4' Fitted: 48\"W × 30\"H × 24\"D\n🔹 Imprint Method\n🖨️ Full-Color Dye Sublimation (Full Bleed)\n🔹 Materials\n🧵 Fabric: Stretch Polyester Blend\n🔹 Compatibility\n📐 Designed to fit standard event tables (size options available)\n🔹 Primary Usage\nTrade shows, exhibitions, vendor booths, conferences, retail promotions, pop-up shops, and brand activations.\nWarranty\nWe stand behind the quality of our products. Our warranty covers any factory defects or damage that occurs during shipping. However, please note that we do not cover damage resulting from extreme weather conditions, misuse, or any circumstances beyond our control.",
