    "description": "<h3 data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1161\"><strong data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1159\">Custom Food Booths Collection</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1430\">Serve your customers in style with our <strong data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1224\">Custom Food Booths</strong>, designed for food vendors, farmers’ markets, festivals, and outdoor events. Available in <strong data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1366\">all popular sizes: 5x5, 10x10, 10x15, and 10x20</strong>, our booths offer flexible options to fit any space or crowd.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1568\">Each booth combines <strong data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1505\">durability, professional branding, and easy setup</strong>, helping your stand look inviting and attract more visitors.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1677\">🏕️ <strong data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1593\">Multiple Sizes:</strong> 5x5, 10x10, 10x15, 10x20 – choose the perfect size for your booth or event space.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1767\">💪 <strong data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1701\">Durable Frames:</strong> Heavy-duty aluminum or steel frames for long-lasting stability.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1888\">🎨 <strong data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1792\">Custom Printing:</strong> Full-color dye-sublimation printing on canopy and walls for vibrant, fade-resistant branding.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"2019\">🧱 <strong data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1940\">Half Side Walls with Mesh &amp; Full Back Wall:</strong> Ventilation and customer interaction combined with maximum brand visibility.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2114\">⚙️ <strong data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2048\">Quick Pop-Up Design:</strong> Tool-free setup allows you to have your booth ready in minutes.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2203\">🧳 <strong data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2150\">Wheeled Carry Bag Included:</strong> Makes transport and storage simple and convenient.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2413\">🎁 <strong data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2229\">Complete Package:</strong> Includes frame, canopy top, printed walls, wheeled carry bag, <strong data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2315\">free design service</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2338\">fast delivery</strong>. Optional accessories include table covers, feather flags, and sandbags.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2574\">Perfect for <strong data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2490\">food vendors, pop-ups, outdoor events, and farmers’ markets</strong>, our Food Booths help you serve efficiently while showcasing your brand in style.</p>",
